  },
  {
   "v": "nastya",
   "t": "Мне станет легче, если отомстить?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Will I feel better if I get revenge?' Literally 'to me will become lighter'. The word ",
